kisi-ibis – IBIS parser of kisi (GPL-3.0-only, see LICENSE in the repository root).

The structure of the parser (src/parser.rs: section contexts and continuation states, the rules for
keywords, the comment character, [Pin] columns, [Package] rows, [Ramp] dV/dt values, waveform
fixtures and package-model matrices) and the list of checks follow the KIBIS parser of KiCad
(eeschema/sim/kibis/ibis_parser.cpp, https://github.com/KiCad/kicad-source-mirror, read at commit
874060a), which is distributed under the following licence:

